# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on every OS.
# Biome formats with LF; a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would
# otherwise turn each file to CRLF and fail `biome ci` locally (CI runs on Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
